[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 2162.31, "timestamp": "00:36:02", "text": "難しいけれど、グループとしてベストを尽くすのは良いことだ"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2165.109, "timestamp": "00:36:05", "text": "そして、ご存知のように、私たちは最善を尽くします"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2168.349, "timestamp": "00:36:08", "text": "互いに支え合い、教え合い、成長していく"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2171.87, "timestamp": "00:36:11", "text": "一緒に競争しないで、"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2174.47, "timestamp": "00:36:14", "text": "ライバル関係ではなく、ただ一緒に楽しい時間を過ごそう"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2176.99, "timestamp": "00:36:16", "text": "一緒にゲームをして楽しもう"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2181.15, "timestamp": "00:36:21", "text": "など、それが私の望みでした"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2184.95, "timestamp": "00:36:24", "text": "でも、物事はそんな風には進まない。その"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2188.069, "timestamp": "00:36:28", "text": "幸せじゃない、幸せ、楽しそう、幸せとか、えっと"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2190.03, "timestamp": "00:36:30", "text": "いつまでも幸せ"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2193.63, "timestamp": "00:36:33", "text": "後。それで、私は"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2196.95, "timestamp": "00:36:36", "text": "気分が悪かった、そう、私はそれを学んだ"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2199.91, "timestamp": "00:36:39", "text": "困難な道。彼女の人生はそうではない。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2201.39, "timestamp": "00:36:41", "text": "そうではありません"}, {"type": "chat", "time": 2201.76, "timestamp": "00:36:41", "author": "@N_I_R_NASHAK", "avatar": "https://yt4.ggpht.com/1tUEQ85FwbdYgcMSwBtAKUjwpzN8k-JYCUeDTQQXUvSFn0hVEvGSW0HPICJMtxNg5tVEcjZ-cOc=s64-c-k-c0x00ffffff-no-rj", "message": "i mean who else is covering in vtubing literally no one you did and good job you did the best but what else can we say the space is small and planet type like there's no big co op in space"}, {"type": "chat", "time": 2212.282, "timestamp": "00:36:52", "author": "@N_I_R_NASHAK", "avatar": "https://yt4.ggpht.com/1tUEQ85FwbdYgcMSwBtAKUjwpzN8k-JYCUeDTQQXUvSFn0hVEvGSW0HPICJMtxNg5tVEcjZ-cOc=s64-c-k-c0x00ffffff-no-rj", "message": "we're still figuring stuff out th